#: scrnsave.cpp:178
msgid "Screen Saver"
msgstr "Screen Saver"

#: scrnsave.cpp:188
msgid ""
"This is a list of the available screen savers. Select the one you want to "
"use."
msgstr "Ovo je lista dostupnih screen saver-a. Izaberite onaj koji želite koristiti."

#: scrnsave.cpp:192
msgid "&Setup..."
msgstr "&Podesi..."

#: scrnsave.cpp:196
msgid ""
"If the screen saver you selected has customizable features, you can set them "
"up by clicking this button."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko screen saver koji ste izabrali ima dodatne opcije, možete ih "
"podesiti tako što ćete kliknuti na ovo dugme."

#: scrnsave.cpp:199
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "&Testiraj"

#: scrnsave.cpp:203
msgid ""
"You can try out the screen saver by clicking this button. (Also, the preview "
"image shows you what the screen saver will look like.)"
msgstr ""
"Možete isprobati screen saver ako kliknete na ovo dugme. (Također, na "
"slici koja se nalazi desno možete vidjeti kako screen saver izgleda.)"

#: scrnsave.cpp:215
msgid "Here you can see a preview of the selected screen saver."
msgstr "Ovjde možete vidjeti kako screen saver koji ste izabrali izgleda."

#: scrnsave.cpp:217
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Postavke"

#: scrnsave.cpp:223
msgid "Start screen saver a&utomatically"
msgstr "Pokreni screen saver a&utomatski"

#: scrnsave.cpp:225
msgid ""
"When you check this option, the selected screen saver will be started "
"automatically after a certain number of minutes of inactivity. This timeout "
"period can be set using the spinbox below."
msgstr ""
"Ako označite ovu opciju izabrani screen saver će biti pokrenut automatski "
"nakon određenog vremena neaktivnosti. Ovo vrijeme možete odrediti u "
"spinbox-u ispod."

#: scrnsave.cpp:234
msgid "After:"
msgstr "Nakon:"

#: scrnsave.cpp:240
msgid " minutes"
msgstr " minuta"

#: scrnsave.cpp:241
msgid "1 minute"
msgstr " 1 minuta"

#: scrnsave.cpp:248
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the screen saver should start. "
"To prevent the screen saver from automatically starting, uncheck the above "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite period neaktivnosti poslije kojeg će se screen saver pokrenuti. "
"Da bi spriječili automatsko pokretanje screen savera isključite gornju "
"opciju."

#: scrnsave.cpp:254
msgid "Make the screen saver aware of power management"
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:259
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want to disable the screen saver while watching TV "
"or movies."
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:261
msgid "&Require password to stop screen saver"
msgstr "Zah&tjevaj šifru za zaustavljanje screen savera"

#: scrnsave.cpp:266
msgid ""
"If you check this option, the display will be locked when the screen saver "
"starts. To restore the display, enter your account password at the prompt."
msgstr ""
"Ako uključite ovu opciju, display će biti zaključan kada se screen saver "
"pokrene. Da se vratite nazad na display, ukucajte šifru vašeg accounta na "
"promptu."

#: scrnsave.cpp:273
msgid "&Priority:"
msgstr "&Prioritet:"

#: scrnsave.cpp:285
msgid ""
"Use this slider to change the processing priority for the screen saver over "
"other jobs that are being executed in the background. For a "
"processor-intensive screen saver, setting a higher priority may make the "
"display smoother at the expense of other jobs."
msgstr ""
"Koristite slider da promijenite prioritet procesiranja za screen saver nad "
"drugim poslovima, koji su pokrenuti u pozadini. "

#: scrnsave.cpp:296
msgid ""
"_: Low Priority\n"
"Low"
msgstr "Nisko"

#: scrnsave.cpp:303
msgid ""
"_: High Priority\n"
"High"
msgstr "Visoko"

#: scrnsave.cpp:512
msgid "Loading..."
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:896
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<h1>Screen Saver</h1> This module allows you to enable and configure a "
"screen saver. Note that you can enable a screen saver even if you have power "
"saving features enabled for your display."
"<p> Besides providing an endless variety of entertainment and preventing "
"monitor burn-in, a screen saver also gives you a simple way to lock your "
"display if you are going to leave it unattended for a while. If you want the "
"screen saver to lock the screen, make sure you enable the \"Require "
"password\" feature of the screen saver. If you don't, you can still "
"explicitly lock the screen using the desktop's \"Lock Screen\" action."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Screen saver</h1> This module allows you to enable and configure a "
"screen saver. Note that you can enable a screen saver even if you have power "
"saving features enabled for your display."
"<p> Besides providing an endless variety of entertainment and preventing "
"monitor burn-in, a screen saver also gives you a simple way to lock your "
"display if you are going to leave it unattended for a while. If you want the "
"screen saver to lock the screen, make sure you enable the \"Require "
"password\" feature of the screen saver. If you don't, you can still "
"explicitly lock the screen using the desktop's \"Lock Screen\" action."

#~ msgid "&Enable screensaver"
#~ msgstr "&Omogući screensaver"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Check this box if you would like to enable a screen saver. If you have "
